Description:It is your first main phase. You control Lovestruck Beast (5/5; it can't attack unless you control a 1/1 creature) and have a second Lovestruck Beast in hand (adventure: Heart's Desire {G}, create a 1/1 Human) with one green mana floating. The opponent is at 5 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-adventure-token-enables-attack | An adventurer card can be cast as its Adventure (CR 715.3): Heart's Desire makes a 1/1, which lets the Beast on the battlefield attack for 5; cast as a creature the second Beast is summoning sick and can't attack either
